              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini worra gugurda Israeli ch'ufa Yerusalemuti wolti yaame. Jennaani jara gugurda gosatifi jara gugurda hayyu hojatufi jaarole gosatifi jari mihaafi hori hayyuutifi ilmaani isaa qorqoratu — akasi jechaani nama mana hayyu keesa hojatu ch'ufafi worra gugurda askartitifi nami jajabaani ch'ufti — Yerusalemuti wolti bahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
