                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Od-dur 17.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini olkae waan jed'eeni: Jaarole, gosa tiyya, na ch'aqasa. Anini mana jaba, Sanduqa Wold'aqisa keesa kayani, ka AABBO Waaqi miila keesa d'aabatu, jaaru fed'e. Anini miha mana isaatini jaaru kurfeese, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammo inni waan nani jed'e, mana keesati na kad'atani naa injaarini, wonti akanatiifi atini nama woraana, ka d'iiga nama heddu buuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi Israeli anaafi d'aloota kiyya fohate, aka nu haga jiru jireenna Israeli mohanu. Inni gosa Yuda fohate, aka hayyuuni keesaa d'alatu, ammalle gosa Yudale keesa worra abba kiyya fohate, worra keennale keesa inni na jaalate, na fohate, hayyu gosa Israeli ch'ufa na tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni ilmaani heddu naa kenne, ilmaani suni keesale Solomoni fohate, aka inni barch'uma hayyuma ka Israeli gubbaa tae lafa AABBO Waaqa mohatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan nani jed'e, Nami Mana na jaaru ilma kanke Solomoni. Anini ya isa fohad'e, aka inni ilma naa tahe, anileeni abba isaa tahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo inni akuma amma na d'agayu kana aadaafi seera kiyya guute jabeese, anini hayyuma isaa haga jiru jireenna jabeesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi amma, gosa tiyya, Waaqa keennafi gumi worra AABBO Waaqa tana ch'ufa durati, seera AABBO Waaqa keenna kana ch'ufa jabeesa guuta, aka akasiini isani lafa dansa tana keesa teettani, ilmaani teesanileeni isani iraa d'aalte, haga jiru jireenna keesa teetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma atinileeni, ilma kiyya Solomoni, Waaqa abba kanketi beekhi, garaa tokofi qalbi tokooni isaa hojad'i. Inni heregaafi fed'i teenna ch'ufa imbeekha, yo barbaadde isa inuma agarta; yo atini isa iraa gorte, inni haga jiru jireenna si abaare si lakisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma beekhu malte, aka AABBO Waaqi si fohate, atini Mana isaa qulqullo jaartu. Jabaad'i, huji suni guuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini aka maneeni sunifi fulla miha keesati olkayanifi d'iibu isaa ch'ufafi Fulla Fulla Ch'ufa Ira Qulqullo ta artiti ch'ubbu nama araaramanifile jaaru malani, Solomoni garsiise t'aafe iti kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni aka qayeefi maneeni d'aatu jirtuufi mana mihaafi waan AABBO Waaqa baasani keesati olkayani jaaru malanile, isa garsiise t'aafe iti kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Daudini aka qaaloleefi worri Lawi huji hojachu male isa garsiise, aka worri huji Mana Waaqa hojate, miha Mana Waaqale qorqoratu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni haga qarsifi worqiini mihaani mid'aasanifi ta ifseefi waan ifseeni ira ejitufi mesa qarsiini mid'aasanifi mesa worqiini mid'aasani, ka qit'a Waaqa baasani ira kayanileeni geetu garsiise ake mid'aasanile iti hime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14+1CH.28.15+1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14",
              "1CH.28.15",
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni ammalle haga worqiini moqa filfilichafi qorifi muduunu mid'aasani gahu malte iti hime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle haga worqiini waan mesa fakaata, ka hit'aana irati aarsanifi gaari waan akheekha lubbu qaba, ka koola, ka Sanduqa Wold'aqisa AABBO Waaqa irati koola ballifte ejitule gohu malte, iti hime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini waan jed'eeni, Wonti kunini ch'ufti waan mani sunini qabaachu male, ka AABBO Waaqi nati hime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini ammalle waan ilma isaa Solomonini jed'e, Ilaafini, garaa jabaad'i. Wonti tokoleeni si ind'owiini, huji suni hojad'i: wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi kiyya si woliini jira. Inni si illakisu, yokhaani si biraa indeemu, haga atini huji Mana Waaqa suni ch'ufa hobaaftuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaaloleefi worra Lawi yayu huji Mana Waaqa iti kenani. Nami hujitifi hogeeyini waan ch'ufa mid'aasitu kurfo jirti, aka si qarqaartu, ammalle gumifi jaaroleeni worraleeni ch'ufti dubbi tante d'ageete gula yaati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waan ijaarsa Mana Waaqatii baasani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
